right.xhtml#29"}, {"id": "en-copyright-30", "kind": "text", "text": "Library of Congress Cataloging-in-Publication Data", "source": "OEBPS/Text/copyright.xhtml#30"}, {"id": "en-copyright-31", "kind": "text", "text": "Names: Watari, Wataru, author. | Ponkan 8, illustrator.", "source": "OEBPS/Text/copyright.xhtml#31"}, {"id": "en-copyright-32", "kind": "text", "text": "Title: My youth romantic comedy is wrong, as I expected / Wataru Watari ; illustration by Ponkan 8.", "source": "OEBPS/Text/copyright.xhtml#32"}, {"id": "en-copyright-33", "kind": "text", "text": "Other titles: Yahari ore no seishun love come wa machigatteiru. English", "source": "OEBPS/Text/copyright.xhtml#33"}, {"id": "en-copyright-34", "kind": "text", "text": "Description: New York : Yen On, 2016–", "source": "OEBPS/Text/copyright.xhtml#34"}, {"id": "en-copyright-35", "kind": "text", "text": "Identifiers: LCCN 2016005816 | ISBN 9780316312295 (v. 1 : pbk.) | ISBN 9780316396011 (v. 2 : pbk.) | ISBN 9780316318068 (v. 3 : pbk.) | ISBN 9780316318075 (v. 4 : pbk.) | ISBN 9780316318082 (v. 5 : pbk.) | ISBN 9780316411868 (v. 6 : pbk.) | ISBN 9781975384166 (v. 6.5 : pbk.) | ISBN 9781975384128 (v. 7 : pbk.) | ISBN 9781975384159 (v. 7.5 : pbk.) | ISBN 9781975384135 (v. 8 : pbk.) | ISBN 9781975384142 (v. 9 : pbk.) | ISBN 9781975384111 (v. 10 : pbk.)", "source": "OEBPS/Text/copyright.xhtml#35"}, {"id": "en-copyright-36", "kind": "text", "text": "Subjects: | CYAC: Optimism—Fiction. | School—Fiction.", "source": "OEBPS/Text/copyright.xhtml#36"}, {"id": "en-copyright-37", "kind": "text", "text": "Classification: LCC PZ7.1.W396 My 2016 | DDC [Fic]—dc23", "source": "OEBPS/Text/copyright.xhtml#37"}, {"id": "en-copyright-38", "kind": "text", "text": "LC record available at http://lccn.loc.gov/2016005816", "source": "OEBPS/Text/copyright.xhtml#38"}, {"id": "en-copyright-39", "kind": "text", "text": "ISBNs: 978-1-9753-8411-1 (paperback)\n978-1-9753-8588-0 (ebook)", "source": "OEBPS/Text/copyright.xhtml#39"}, {"id": "en-copyright-40", "kind": "text", "text": "E3-20201005-JV-NF-ORI", "source": "OEBPS/Text/copyright.xhtml#40"}, {"id": "en-toc-0", "kind": "heading", "text": "Contents", "source": "OEBPS/Text/toc.xhtml#0", "headingLevel": 2}, {"id": "en-toc-1", "kind": "text", "text": "Cover", "source": "OEBPS/Text/toc.xhtml#1"}, {"id": "en-toc-2", "kind": "text", "text": "Insert", "source": "OEBPS/Text/toc.xhtml#2"}, {"id": "en-toc-3", "kind": "text", "text": "Title Page", "source": "OEBPS/Text/toc.xhtml#3"}, {"id": "en-toc-4", "kind": "text", "text": "Copyright", "source": "OEBPS/Text/toc.xhtml#4"}, {"id": "en-toc-5", "kind": "text", "text": "Cast of Characters", "source": "OEBPS/Text/toc.xhtml#5"}, {"id": "en-toc-6", "kind": "text", "text": "The First Notebook: …Possibly, that’s not unique to anyone.", "source": "OEBPS/Text/toc.xhtml#6", "emphasis": [{"start": 0, "end": 18, "style": "strong"}]}, {"id": "en-toc-7", "kind": "text", "text": "1: In the end, Komachi Hikigaya looks for divine help.", "source": "OEBPS/Text/toc.xhtml#7", "emphasis": [{"start": 15, "end": 31, "style": "strong"}]}, {"id": "en-toc-8", "kind": "text", "text": "2: As usual, Haruno Yukinoshita stirs things up.", "source": "OEBPS/Text/toc.xhtml#8", "emphasis": [{"start": 13, "end": 31, "style": "strong"}]}, {"id": "en-toc-9", "kind": "text", "text": "3: At some point, Iroha Isshiki started hanging around.", "source": "OEBPS/Text/toc.xhtml#9", "emphasis": [{"start": 18, "end": 31, "style": "strong"}]}, {"id": "en-toc-10", "kind": "text", "text": "4: Yumiko Miura still wants to know anyway.", "source": "OEBPS/Text/toc.xhtml#10", "emphasis": [{"start": 3, "end": 15, "style": "strong"}]}, {"id": "en-toc-11", "kind": "text", "text": "5: Saika Totsuka is waiting until that someday comes.", "source": "OEBPS/Text/toc.xhtml#11", "emphasis": [{"start": 3, "end": 16, "style": "strong"}]}, {"id": "en-toc-12", "kind": "text", "text": "6: Gallantly, Haruno Yukinoshita departs into the darkness.", "source": "OEBPS/Text/toc.xhtml#12", "emphasis": [{"start": 14, "end": 32, "style": "strong"}]}, {"id": "en-toc-13", "kind": "text", "text": "The Second Notebook: …Or it could be unique to everyone.", "source": "OEBPS/Text/toc.xhtml#13", "emphasis": [{"start": 0, "end": 19, "style": "strong"}]}, {"id": "en-toc-14", "kind": "text", "text": "7: Hayato Hayama always meets expectations.", "source": "OEBPS/Text/toc.xhtml#14", "emphasis": [{"start": 3, "end": 16, "style": "strong"}]}, {"id": "en-toc-15", "kind": "text", "text": "8: That’s how their pasts and futures cross, leading to the present.", "source": "OEBPS/Text/toc.xhtml#15", "emphasis": [{"start": 14, "end": 19, "style": "strong"}]}, {"id": "en-toc-16", "kind": "text", "text": "The Third Notebook: …So then who was it unique to?", "source": "OEBPS/Text/toc.xhtml#16", "emphasis": [{"start": 0, "end": 18, "style": "strong"}]}, {"id": "en-toc-17", "kind": "text", "text": "9: However, Haruno Yukinoshita spake thus.", "source": "OEBPS/Text/toc.xhtml#17", "emphasis": [{"start": 12, "end": 30, "style": "strong"}]}, {"id": "en-toc-18", "kind": "text", "text": "Afterword", "source": "OEBPS/Text/toc.xhtml#18"}, {"id": "en-toc-19", "kind": "text", "text": "Translation Notes", "source": "OEBPS/Text/toc.xhtml#19"}, {"id": "en-toc-20", "kind": "text", "text": "Yen Newsletter", "source": "OEBPS/Text/toc.xhtml#20"}, {"id": "en-preface001-0", "kind": "image", "text": "Book Title Page", "source": "OEBPS/Text/preface001.xhtml#../Images/Art_P1.jpg", "src": "assets/english/volume-10/Art_P1.webp", "width": 1200, "height": 1800}, {"id": "en-preface002-0", "kind": "heading", "text": "The First Notebook", "source": "OEBPS/Text/preface002.xhtml#0", "headingLevel": 2}, {"id": "en-preface002-1", "kind": "heading", "text": "…Possibly, that’s not unique to anyone.", "source": "OEBPS/Text/preface002.xhtml#1", "headingLevel": 2}, {"id": "en-preface002-2", "kind": "text", "text": "“Mine has been a life of much shame.”", "source": "OEBPS/Text/preface002.xhtml#2"}, {"id": "en-preface002-3", "kind": "text", "text": "My gaze happened to land on that line.", "source": "OEBPS/Text/preface002.xhtml#3"}, {"id": "en-preface002-4", "kind": "text", "text": "The end of the year was approaching, and the family was in the middle of a full house clean. As I was organizing my collection of books, my hand unconsciously reached out for a certain one.", "source": "OEBPS/Text/preface002.xhtml#4"}, {"id": "en-preface002-5", "kind": "text", "text": "I think I picked up this particular book, among the many I have, because I felt a strangely intense connection to the title itself, its four characters in Japanese.", "source": "OEBPS/Text/preface002.xhtml#5"}, {"id": "en-preface002-6", "kind": "text", "text": "No Longer Human.", "source": "OEBPS/Text/preface002.xhtml#6", "emphasis": [{"start": 0, "end": 16, "style": "em"}]}, {"id": "en-preface002-7", "kind": "text", "text": "I seemed to recall having read this book around the beginning of middle school.", "source": "OEBPS/Text/preface002.xhtml#7"}, {"id": "en-preface002-8", "kind": "text", "text": "But coming up to the middle of “The Second Notebook,” I’d slammed the book shut, and I hadn’t been able to read it since. It had been a difficult read for me at the time, and it was also a little boring for a middle school kid. There was plenty of other fun stuff out there, and I hadn’t been so starved for entertainment that I needed to bother trying to be all smart and read kind of a hard book.", "source": "OEBPS/Text/preface002.xhtml#8"}, {"id": "en-preface002-9", "kind": "text", "text": "That was why I’d closed this one.", "source": "OEBPS/Text/preface002.xhtml#9"}, {"id": "en-preface002-10", "kind": "text", "text": "Because I’d felt as if I—the person I really am, the person I’ve always kept secret and continued to hide—would be exposed. I had the feeling that even the reason I tried to read this particular book back in middle school was probably written in here.", "source": "OEBPS/Text/preface002.xhtml#10"}, {"id": "en-preface002-11", "kind": "text", "text": "But the reason I was reading it now was because I thought I’d gotten rid of it. I’d been so surprised, I just picked it up.", "source": "OEBPS/Text/preface002.xhtml#11"}, {"id": "en-preface002-12", "kind": "text", "text": "Thinking about it properly, though, there was no way I could get rid of this book.", "source": "OEBPS/Text/preface002.xhtml#12"}, {"id": "en-preface002-13", "kind": "text", "text": "They say that a bookshelf is an expression of its owner’s personality.", "source": "OEBPS/Text/preface002.xhtml#13"}, {"id": "en-preface002-14", "kind": "text", "text": "Then I’m sure this is who I really am. That’s why I could never let go of it, just keeping it closed up, pretending I didn’t see it. But despite that, I had picked it up one more time.", "source": "OEBPS/Text/preface002.xhtml#14"}, {"id": "en-preface002-15", "kind": "text", "text": "A sign or fate.", "source": "OEBPS/Text/preface002.xhtml#15"}, {"id": "en-preface002-16", "kind": "text", "text": "I’m not the type to believe in that stuff, but then being too eager to reject them feels like affirming them, so I don’t like that, either.", "source": "OEBPS/Text/preface002.xhtml#16"}, {"id": "en-preface002-17", "kind": "text", "text": "I wiped the built-up dust off the bookshelf, then went straight over to the sofa to sink down into it—the rest of the book. Going beyond what I hadn’t been able to keep reading back then.", "source": "OEBPS/Text/preface002.xhtml#17"}, {"id": "en-preface002-18", "kind": "text", "text": "I would have to look at it now.", "source": "OEBPS/Text/preface002.xhtml#18"}]}
